face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>스워드</b></font></a><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b> | </b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo/uthrowing/\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>던지는 \n                무기</b></font></a><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b> |</b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo/uwands/\"><b><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"> </font></b><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>완드</b></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><b><font color=\"#996600\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Elite \nUniques</font><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"> </font></b><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>: </b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo/euweapons/\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>무기</b></font></a><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b> | </b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo/euarmor/\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>아머</b></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#CCCCCC\" bordercolordark=\"#CCCCCC\" bordercolorlight=\"#CCCCCC\" cellpadding=\"7\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"580\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#F8F8F8\" colspan=\"3\" height=\"30\" width=\"562\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20011220005748/http://forg.co.kr:80/Diablo/sets7.shtml#sandersfolly\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>&nbsp;</b></font></a><font color=\"#CC9900\" face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><b>Unique Amulets \n                            </b></font><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>[목걸이]</b></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"black\" width=\"95\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span><img height=\"33\" src=\"/img/posts/site/Diablo/images/item/unique/amu2.gif\" width=\"32\">\n</span></font></p><center>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span><font color=\"#908858\"><span><b>Nokozan \nRelic</b></span></font></span></font>\n</p><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"white\" face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span><span>Amulet</span></span></font></p></center></td>\n<td bgcolor=\"white\" width=\"213\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span>Required Level: 10<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">20% Faster Hit Recovery</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">Fire Resist \n+50%</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+10 To Maximum Fire Resist</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">Adds 3-6 Fire Damage</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+3 To Light \nRadius</font><br>(Only Spawns In Patch 1.09 or later)  </span></font> </p></td>\n<td width=\"222\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span>레벨 \n                            요구치 : 10<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">20% 빠른 회복 속도 </font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">파이어 저항력 +50%</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+10 최대 파이어 저항력</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">파이어 데미지 3-6 추가</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+3 시야 증가</font><br>(1.09 패치이후부터 \n                            얻을 수 있음)</span></font> </p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"black\" width=\"95\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span><img height=\"33\" src=\"/img/posts/site/Diablo/images/item/unique/amu2.gif\" width=\"32\">\n</span></font></p><center>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\